						 <p>Well, this is a throwback of the highest degree. I respect the attempt to resurrect the collaborative log variable-input machine with a new twist, but these outputs are just one-line pseudo-dirty jokes, and not very interesting ones at that. I spent more time rolling my eyes than laughing, unfortunately.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
